      "en": "The LORD looked down from heaven on the children of men, to see if there were any who understood, who sought after God.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 하늘에서 인생을 굽어 살피사 지각이 있어 하나님을 찾는 자가 있는가 보려 하신즉",
      "source_text_hash": "5a4dd9fae287d2a20761c646f5459fccb8de6a3fdb21dd0101824c9aac6ccbb3",
      "translation_text_hash": "d73f7640e3d94fab34ffc665e4e62e65711ecea0b2da4596e83d8ef6ade56af5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
